#: e7b8eff21d0642bfb95e7ea29f5ce84d
msgid "预计算和存储 Clebsch-Gordan (CG) 系数的模块。"
msgstr "A module to precompute and store Clebsch-Gordan (CG) coefficients."

#: c5c20573b77f4c74be684567ac02e66b
msgid ""
"该模块利用 `e3nn.o3.wigner_3j` 来计算 Wigner 3j 符号，并通过它们得到 CG 系数。 Wigner 3j 符号与 "
"CG 系数通过以下关系相关联："
msgstr "This module uses `e3nn.o3.wigner_3j` to compute Wigner 3j symbols and derives the CG coefficients from them. The Wigner 3j symbols are related to the CG coefficients by the following relation:"

#: fccf89c6e47949d691ff6c1fb5519314
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\langle l_1 m_1, l_2 m_2 | l_3 m_3 \\rangle =\n"
"(-1)^{l_1 - l_2 + m_3} \\sqrt{2l_3 + 1}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix} l_1 & l_2 & l_3 \\\\ m_1 & m_2 & -m_3 \\end{pmatrix}"
msgstr ""
"\\langle l_1 m_1, l_2 m_2 | l_3 m_3 \\rangle =\n"
"(-1)^{l_1 - l_2 + m_3} \\sqrt{2l_3 + 1}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix} l_1 & l_2 & l_3 \\\\ m_1 & m_2 & -m_3 \\end{pmatrix}"

#: 0164b2a9010c43738989ea40781c26f3
msgid "通过将系数注册为缓冲区 (buffer)，可以在模型的前向传播过程中高效访问，避免重复计算。"
msgstr "By registering the coefficients as buffers, they can be accessed efficiently during the model's forward pass, avoiding repeated calculations."

#: 59b61039d9ca4956a782d9542d106d6b
msgid "获取给定角动量的预计算 Clebsch-Gordan 系数。"
msgstr "Get the precomputed Clebsch-Gordan coefficients for the given angular momenta."

#: ecba6dfb4b254c9fb46d86741b62d4ce
msgid "第一个角动量。"
msgstr "The first angular momentum."

#: dad87510a0bc497a8f100d8c46c354d1
msgid "第二个角动量。"
msgstr "The second angular momentum."

#: c440b33c5bac4a1e83dc82fadab47cae
msgid "第三个角动量。"
msgstr "The third angular momentum."

#: d69a0eb73b1e4f64b98b8db85e1bcdc9
msgid "对应的 Clebsch-Gordan 系数张量。"
msgstr "The corresponding Clebsch-Gordan coefficient tensor."

#: dc5ea61097034dc0b29f0e84df04e283
msgid "一个线性缩放模块，其权重由外部提供。"
msgstr "A linear scaling module whose weights are provided externally."

#: cda794df8ecd4a0788a1556d67e00881
msgid ""
"该模块首先通过张量积(tensor product)将输入特征与一个伪标量(pseudo-scalar)相乘， "
"然后应用一个外部提供的权重向量。最后，通过一个线性层将结果映射到输出的不可约表示。"
msgstr "This module first multiplies the input features with a pseudo-scalar via a tensor product, then applies an externally provided weight vector. Finally, the result is mapped to the output irreducible representations through a linear layer."

#: 7a5e538d73434b7c884f1dd74398aa1d
msgid "带权重的线性变换前向传播。"
msgstr "Forward pass for the weighted linear transformation."

#: 4c042fa5997149cbb3c07cfda24d8eb0 930240bb22d84b3c9c994ae36a694f3a
#: ba935f31688b4d10a714da5b811bae63
