msgid "模块的前向传播。"
msgstr "Forward pass of the module."

#: 41b42539abb74588b336079c501207c5
msgid "对输入的边距离应用软单位阶跃函数。"
msgstr "Applies the soft unit step function to the input edge distances."

#: 36c8c1488bf54ee4bd66eda60d677fec
msgid "包含边距离的张量。"
msgstr "Tensor containing edge distances."

#: 62481d0f856c4899b0eab0e337fc21e8
msgid "应用截断后计算得到的边权重张量。"
msgstr "The edge weight tensor calculated after applying the cutoff."

#: 9ff8e97615db4927954bf7903c6343c5
msgid "计算图中每个节点的邻居数量。"
msgstr "Calculate the number of neighbors for each node in the graph."

#: 531cec674cce4b328fd8bb349b872841
msgid "包含源节点索引的一维张量 (通常是 `edge_index[0]`)。"
msgstr "A 1D tensor containing the source node indices (usually `edge_index[0]`)."

#: 70b94cd044db4a1db1007818c3d4b498
msgid "一个张量，其索引对应节点ID，值为该节点的邻居数量。"
msgstr "A tensor where the index corresponds to the node ID and the value is the number of neighbors for that node."

#: ec5aad121642444b83ffe309d9d851c4
msgid "一个带有内存优化和动态权重的张量积模块。"
msgstr "A tensor product module with memory optimization and dynamic weights."

#: 37920fa719074461ad387a62f3073a49
msgid "该模块通过一个径向多层感知机(MLP)或KAN网络从标量输入动态生成权重， 然后将这些权重应用于两个输入不可约表示(irreps)的张量积结果。"
msgstr "This module dynamically generates weights from a scalar input via a radial Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP) or KAN network, and then applies these weights to the tensor product result of two input irreducible representations (irreps)."

#: 4df7cac76a4f4dcd83555ab15fbb701b
msgid "TensorProductWithMemoryOptimizationWithWeight 模块的前向传播。"
msgstr "Forward pass for the TensorProductWithMemoryOptimizationWithWeight module."

#: 6c17d4b10c664264aa0d84ea526d0c60 d3581fd73f8342db854408fd79baa396
msgid "第一个不可约表示的输入张量。"
msgstr "The input tensor for the first irreducible representation."

#: 9636c163b5a44d51ba0d4edd8cdd6ee5 e8d157ae6cc74571b87ab46ef52d01a3
msgid "第二个不可约表示的输入张量。"
msgstr "The input tensor for the second irreducible representation."

#: cbb1ecc19ef54550a782975ea2673d05
msgid "用于生成权重的标量输入张量。"
msgstr "The scalar input tensor used to generate weights."

#: 6131597adad5441081492893dbc05cdb 9898bd4fe9fb4c1594ee9666e5a56860
msgid "应用张量积和缩放后的输出张量。"
msgstr "The output tensor after applying the tensor product and scaling."

#: 5dff8ae9400046f7bbc6921fc1b390e3
msgid "一个带内存优化的张量积模块，专门处理至少一个输入是标量的情况。"
msgstr "A tensor product module with memory optimization, specialized for cases where at least one input is a scalar."

#: 197a2a0245c04ca19c6be0c776f9f495
msgid "从给定的不可约表示中提取并返回标量不可约表示。"
msgstr "Extracts and returns the scalar irreducible representations from a given set of irreps."

#: af4b11a3b3624105810b71c9ea6237ca
msgid ""
"标量不可约表示定义为 l=0 且 p=1 (即 '0e') 的表示。 该函数计算此类标量不可约表示的总多重度，并构造一个仅包含这些表示的新 "
"Irreps 对象。"
msgstr "Scalar irreducible representations are defined as those with l=0 and p=1 (i.e., '0e'). This function calculates the total multiplicity of such scalar irreps and constructs a new Irreps object containing only them."

#: b17c15df82944d309ec463aeeb26c0c9
msgid "要从中提取标量分量的输入不可约表示。"
msgstr "The input irreducible representations from which to extract the scalar components."

#: 68d8ea71ac9b4620b394f80b56282abe
msgid "仅包含标量分量的新 Irreps 对象。"
msgstr "A new Irreps object containing only the scalar components."

#: c68fa5af5a14461ab91ee382f0be435a
msgid "一个从源节点属性、目标节点属性和边嵌入计算边标量的层。"
msgstr "A layer that computes edge scalars from source node attributes, destination node attributes, and edge embeddings."

#: 02b9d6acfee54172bc0267e098754cf0
msgid "前向传播，计算边标量。"
msgstr "Forward pass to compute edge scalars."

#: dfe36ff092f4470e849d3efc7a450834
msgid "源节点属性。"
msgstr "Source node attributes."

#: ec153aa277f947568d8332406276975d
